WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 17=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:50.800 --> 01:53.430
The bed curtains and bedding have all
been replaced with new ones.

01:53.430 --> 01:54.360
We had very little time,

01:54.370 --> 01:55.919
so the preparations may
not be quite complete.

01:55.920 --> 01:57.718
Third Young Lady, if you need anything,

01:57.719 --> 01:59.119
just let me know.

01:59.432 --> 02:01.790
Baogai has gone to prepare
some hot water for you to drink.

02:01.799 --> 02:03.358
It should be brought over shortly.

02:03.359 --> 02:05.919
Someone will also bring hot water
first thing tomorrow morning.

02:06.159 --> 02:07.639
I'm fine.

02:07.640 --> 02:09.768
See to Aunt Lingxiao and Jinlan first.

02:10.319 --> 02:12.079
It's fine. There's enough for everyone.

02:15.800 --> 02:16.680
Lanxiang!

02:29.800 --> 02:32.878
First Madam knows Jinlan
shouldn't be burdened with worry,

02:32.879 --> 02:34.559
yet she put him in charge.

02:34.560 --> 02:36.199
In truth, she's relying on you.

02:37.280 --> 02:39.799
Jinqi also said he trusts you.

02:40.280 --> 02:43.479
Clearly, you're capable and dependable.

02:44.120 --> 02:45.918
You're too kind, Third Young Lady.

02:45.919 --> 02:48.799
I'll naturally do my utmost
to carry out my masters' instructions.

02:50.120 --> 02:51.160
Please sit.

02:53.080 --> 02:55.840
When I went to see Jinqi
at the Hour of Xu,

02:56.000 --> 02:58.440
he asked why
I hadn't brought a maid with me.

02:58.520 --> 03:01.280
I sent Tongcao to follow Lingdang.

03:03.039 --> 03:03.918
Tongcao,

03:03.919 --> 03:05.038
tell Lanxiang

03:05.039 --> 03:06.479
what you saw.

03:09.080 --> 03:10.799
After leaving Zhichun Hall,

03:10.800 --> 03:13.759
Young Lady Du
said something to Lingdang,

03:14.039 --> 03:15.799
and Lingdang left.

03:17.560 --> 03:19.519
I followed Lingdang the whole way.

03:19.520 --> 03:21.440
She was very cautious,

03:21.560 --> 03:23.519
constantly looking around.

03:23.840 --> 03:26.000
But I was born into the Lin household

03:26.010 --> 03:27.890
and have served
Young Lady since I was little.

03:28.008 --> 03:30.790
I know the residence so well that
I could walk it with my eyes closed.

03:30.919 --> 03:32.799
Naturally, she couldn't spot me.

03:32.919 --> 03:34.359
Later,

03:34.400 --> 03:38.079
I followed Lingdang
to Second Young Master's courtyard.

03:38.439 --> 03:40.880
Lingdang didn't go inside either.

03:41.120 --> 03:44.759
She just said something to two maids
who were delivering hot water,

03:45.039 --> 03:46.359
and then left.

03:47.240 --> 03:50.079
I followed Lingdang back to Luxue Lodge.

03:50.080 --> 03:51.730
After I saw them
lock the courtyard gate,

03:51.740 --> 03:54.519
I returned to Yujiao Garden
and reported back to Young Lady.

03:57.479 --> 04:00.280
It does sound like there's
something odd about Lingdang.

04:00.290 --> 04:03.230
Why wouldn't she accompany Young Lady Du
back to her room so late at night?

04:03.240 --> 04:04.630
I thought it was strange, too,

04:04.680 --> 04:06.400
so I couldn't help telling you.

04:07.240 --> 04:09.999
For now, there's nothing clearly wrong.

04:10.000 --> 04:10.919
But...

04:12.759 --> 04:13.840
But...

04:14.759 --> 04:18.719
Lingdang did come
from outside the household, after all.

04:18.920 --> 04:21.079
You can never truly know
what's in someone's heart.

04:21.560 --> 04:24.559
Now that we're living
in the same courtyard,

04:24.560 --> 04:26.480
and First Madam
has put you in charge,

04:26.560 --> 04:29.839
I thought I should tell you,

04:30.000 --> 04:31.440
so you can be on your guard...

04:34.160 --> 04:35.480
and be prepared.

04:37.519 --> 04:39.320
Please don't think I'm meddling.

04:39.330 --> 04:41.239
After all, we should
never seek to harm others,

04:41.240 --> 04:43.079
but we must always guard against them.

04:53.000 --> 04:54.438
Don't worry, Third Young Lady.

04:54.439 --> 04:56.079
I'll be sure to keep an eye on

04:57.160 --> 04:58.279
Lingdang.

05:04.920 --> 05:08.199
I won't keep you from your work, then.

05:08.439 --> 05:09.839
Go on and get back to it.

05:15.519 --> 05:16.480
Lanxiang.

05:18.920 --> 05:20.079
It's dark at night.

05:20.279 --> 05:21.279
Take this.

05:57.600 --> 05:58.800
You're back.

06:06.720 --> 06:08.320
We still have duties tomorrow morning.

06:08.879 --> 06:10.279
Get some sleep.

06:10.720 --> 06:14.199
You and I have taken turns looking
after Yuchan these past two days.

06:14.600 --> 06:16.399
Neither of us
has developed a single rash.

06:16.480 --> 06:17.959
But Xiaolian...

06:18.839 --> 06:21.078
Everyone else at Luxue Lodge is fine.

06:21.079 --> 06:22.800
She's the only one who fell ill.

06:25.079 --> 06:27.199
You were with Second Madam today.

06:27.360 --> 06:29.639
Did Young Lady Du say anything to you?

06:30.720 --> 06:34.399
Young Lady Du chatted with me for a bit.

06:34.888 --> 06:37.070
She remarked on how hard
Young Master had been working,

06:37.079 --> 06:39.199
having to go out
right after taking a bath.

06:43.720 --> 06:44.800
What's wrong?

06:46.879 --> 06:49.079
Tell me exactly
what Young Lady Du said again.

06:50.839 --> 06:54.079
Young Lady Du said Young Master
had been working hard,

06:54.720 --> 06:56.680
having to go out
right after taking a bath.

06:58.480 --> 07:00.040
What did you say?

07:00.079 --> 07:02.040
I've been looking
after Yuchan this whole time.

07:02.720 --> 07:05.159
How would I know
when Young Master went out?

07:05.600 --> 07:07.359
I just smiled and agreed,

07:07.360 --> 07:09.640
saying that Young Master
had indeed been working hard,

07:09.704 --> 07:11.190
and then I left.

07:11.600 --> 07:12.920
A bath...

07:15.079 --> 07:17.399
Lingdang went to Qingyan Hall.

07:18.720 --> 07:20.800
The maids carrying water...

07:23.680 --> 07:24.800
No.

07:25.680 --> 07:26.759
Hot water.

07:38.160 --> 07:39.000
Baogai.

07:42.000 --> 07:43.360
Where do you need hot water?

07:44.120 --> 07:45.360
I don't need any hot water.

07:47.160 --> 07:49.959
I just came to talk to you.

07:51.240 --> 07:52.360
At this hour?

07:52.439 --> 07:53.959
What could be so important?

07:57.879 --> 07:59.999
The day Young Master
returned from the prison,

08:00.000 --> 08:01.438
the same day Yuchan and I

08:01.439 --> 08:03.639
returned from
the Naval Camp outside the city,

08:03.759 --> 08:05.360
did Lingdang come by?

08:07.160 --> 08:08.320
She did.

08:09.040 --> 08:10.199
Are you sure?

08:10.759 --> 08:11.839
I'm sure.

08:11.864 --> 08:13.310
It was only the afternoon that day,

08:13.319 --> 08:15.398
but you and Yuchan
wanted hot water for a bath.

08:15.400 --> 08:17.592
I hurried to have
the junior maids heat some water.

08:18.279 --> 08:21.360
I still remember there
wasn't enough the first time.

08:21.519 --> 08:23.880
So I had another two buckets
of hot water heated for you.

08:24.184 --> 08:26.750
Lingdang came when you were
heating the first batch of water?

08:28.879 --> 08:30.880
I suffer from menstrual cramps.

08:31.040 --> 08:32.239
After Lingdang found out,

08:32.240 --> 08:34.280
she asked Young Lady Du
for some medicine for me.

08:34.519 --> 08:36.719
That day, she came to bring me the pills

08:36.759 --> 08:38.599
just as I was
busy telling the junior maids

08:38.600 --> 08:40.479
to bring hot water to Yuchan and you.

08:42.559 --> 08:44.119
She even waited for a while.

08:44.159 --> 08:45.119
After I finished,

08:45.120 --> 08:46.839
she explained how to take the medicine.

08:49.759 --> 08:51.599
That day, Xiaolian came to see me.

08:52.039 --> 08:54.119
We talked for a while,

08:54.279 --> 08:56.959
and just then, Yuchan said
she didn't have enough hot water,

08:57.399 --> 08:59.879
so I gave her mine.

09:00.919 --> 09:04.359
Early the next morning,
Yuchan developed a red rash.

09:08.279 --> 09:10.199
You came all this way late at night

09:10.799 --> 09:12.320
just to ask about this?

09:13.039 --> 09:14.158
No one can know

09:14.159 --> 09:15.760
that I asked you about this.

09:21.720 --> 09:24.680
(Could the epidemic
be something other than an illness?)

10:20.200 --> 10:22.280
(Young Master,
aren't you going to take a bath?)

10:22.399 --> 10:24.518
(I poured in a whole bucket
of hot water just now)

10:24.519 --> 10:26.560
(to make some splashing sounds.)

10:27.000 --> 10:27.999
(It's a little hot.)

10:40.080 --> 10:40.798
It's me.

10:40.799 --> 10:41.839
Nanke.

10:44.200 --> 10:45.520
I recognized you.

10:52.200 --> 10:53.839
Has First Madam moved here?

10:54.000 --> 10:55.798
First Madam
is still at Rongzhang House.

10:55.800 --> 10:57.832
She said she needs
to look after Fourth Young Lady.

11:06.320 --> 11:08.320
I suspect the epidemic in the residence

11:08.399 --> 11:09.400
isn't an illness,

11:10.120 --> 11:11.800
but someone poisoning people.

11:12.904 --> 11:13.864
You were sneaking around

11:13.912 --> 11:16.520
because you suspect there's
something wrong with the bathwater?

11:17.840 --> 11:19.319
The maids are very careful

11:19.320 --> 11:20.999
with the masters' food.

11:21.000 --> 11:22.800
It's kept covered,

11:22.879 --> 11:24.520
so it's not easy to tamper with.

11:24.840 --> 11:26.760
But the hot water for bathing

11:27.200 --> 11:28.719
isn't watched as closely

11:28.720 --> 11:30.400
when the maids deliver it.

11:31.080 --> 11:32.319
I suspect

11:32.320 --> 11:35.280
someone has
been poisoning the bathwater.

11:36.080 --> 11:37.199
Who do you suspect?

11:40.440 --> 11:42.199
Young Lady Du and Lingdang.

11:49.120 --> 11:50.839
It's only a suspicion.

11:51.879 --> 11:53.640
Perhaps I'm overthinking it.

12:01.799 --> 12:02.800
Let me.

12:16.264 --> 12:17.576
Please take this to Young Master

12:17.580 --> 12:19.560
and ask him to
have an imperial physician

12:19.570 --> 12:21.688
from the Imperial Medical Service
examine it.

12:22.600 --> 12:23.560
All right.

12:28.120 --> 12:29.520
There's one more thing

12:29.600 --> 12:31.160
I'd like to ask your help with.

12:33.780 --> 12:39.020
(Father, Mother, please don't worry.
Your daughter, Lanxiang)

12:42.279 --> 12:44.599
It must be wonderful
to know how to read and write.

12:45.960 --> 12:47.079
If you want to learn,

12:47.080 --> 12:48.280
I'll teach you.

12:48.399 --> 12:49.479
Really?

12:50.720 --> 12:52.479
Can I learn?

12:54.279 --> 12:57.398
My father learned
to read and write from me.

12:57.399 --> 12:58.839
As long as we're determined,

12:58.840 --> 13:00.840
if we learn two
or three characters every day,

13:00.904 --> 13:03.390
we'll know around
a thousand after a year.

13:03.399 --> 13:05.400
That's enough
for everyday reading and writing.

13:05.480 --> 13:06.398
I am.

13:06.399 --> 13:07.680
I'm determined.

13:20.559 --> 13:21.920
Can she be trusted?

13:28.600 --> 13:30.280
First Madam
has developed a red rash, too.

13:32.080 --> 13:33.999
First Madam
took a bath during the day?

13:34.000 --> 13:34.790
First Madam said she

13:34.808 --> 13:37.590
worked up a sweat while looking after
Fourth Young Lady during the day,

13:37.720 --> 13:39.239
so she had the maids prepare hot water

13:39.240 --> 13:40.400
for a bath.

13:40.519 --> 13:43.079
Du Cuique and Du Zheng came
to pay their respects at the time

13:43.080 --> 13:44.119
and heard her.

13:44.120 --> 13:45.719
What did First Madam say?

13:45.720 --> 13:47.158
Until we have solid evidence,

13:47.159 --> 13:48.719
we must not act rashly.

13:48.720 --> 13:50.456
The Lin family
cannot afford to be accused

13:50.472 --> 13:51.950
of plotting to harm their lifesavers.

14:07.900 --> 14:09.980
(Lin Residence)

14:11.560 --> 14:14.072
These are First Madam's household
authority token and seal.

14:15.159 --> 14:16.800
First Madam said...

14:17.840 --> 14:19.920
(Lin Residence)
Second Madam is kindhearted,

14:20.399 --> 14:23.359
but easily swayed
and quick to believe rumors.

14:23.360 --> 14:24.760
She can't handle important matters.

14:25.399 --> 14:26.678
Jinlan is intelligent,

14:26.679 --> 14:28.199
but he has a heart condition.

14:29.159 --> 14:31.440
Jinqiao may look big and strong,

14:31.480 --> 14:34.040
but he's still a child at heart.

14:35.679 --> 14:38.119
Second Young Madam
comes from humble origins

14:38.159 --> 14:39.719
and is timid by nature.

14:40.328 --> 14:42.920
She can't keep the people and affairs
of the residence in order.

14:43.919 --> 14:47.280
Xiuwan is spoiled, while Xiuru is timid.

14:48.536 --> 14:50.430
There are so many masters
in this residence,

14:50.440 --> 14:52.479
yet not one of them
can manage the household.

14:58.399 --> 15:01.079
I know about the things Lanxiang

15:01.080 --> 15:02.440
has done for Young Master.

15:02.919 --> 15:04.800
She's intelligent and capable.

15:05.224 --> 15:07.230
Desperate times call
for exceptional measures.

15:07.919 --> 15:11.199
I'm entrusting
the inner residence to Lanxiang.

15:11.399 --> 15:13.959
If I fall unconscious with a fever

15:13.960 --> 15:15.439
before Young Master returns,

15:15.440 --> 15:17.158
Lanxiang will take these

15:17.160 --> 15:19.096
and assist Jinlan
in managing the household.

15:21.000 --> 15:22.719
Xiushu's life and mine,

15:23.576 --> 15:25.800
as well as the lives
of everyone in Fengqi Courtyard,

15:26.320 --> 15:28.079
will all be entrusted to Lanxiang.

15:36.240 --> 15:36.879
The letter.

15:43.840 --> 15:45.079
Thank you.

16:03.704 --> 16:06.280
There's something about
Young Lady Du I need to tell you.

16:07.080 --> 16:08.199
What is it?

16:12.600 --> 16:14.878
When I was chatting
with Young Lady Du earlier,

16:14.879 --> 16:16.319
she was about to go to bed.

16:16.320 --> 16:17.839
I saw that she was wearing

16:17.840 --> 16:19.558
an undershirt made of Xinggu gauze.

16:19.559 --> 16:21.638
I've only ever seen this fabric once.

16:21.639 --> 16:24.239
It was when
Young Madam Zhao was staying here.

16:24.240 --> 16:26.320
She had two undershirts like this.

16:26.399 --> 16:28.678
She said they were
woven from banana fibers

16:28.679 --> 16:29.959
and were extremely precious.

16:30.639 --> 16:32.520
But how could Young Lady Du

16:32.639 --> 16:34.760
have such expensive clothing?

16:36.200 --> 16:37.560
It was a gift.

16:38.879 --> 16:41.398
That person also gave her
Yunzi stones worth a fortune

16:41.399 --> 16:43.199
to win Du Cuique's favor.

16:43.559 --> 16:44.320
Well...

16:49.639 --> 16:51.479
Yuchan and Xiaolian

16:51.600 --> 16:53.479
are both at Fengqi Courtyard now.

16:53.919 --> 16:55.719
Is there anything I can do to help?

16:56.840 --> 16:57.800
Yes.

16:58.919 --> 17:02.119
When you serve Second Young Master
and Second Young Madam tomorrow,

17:02.120 --> 17:03.680
quietly ask around.

17:26.920 --> 17:28.040
What are you doing?

17:31.599 --> 17:33.439
What do you want?

17:34.559 --> 17:35.720
Let go of me!

18:12.799 --> 18:14.320
You're a grown man.

18:14.359 --> 18:17.240
Why do you look like you've seen
a ghost when you see me?

18:20.839 --> 18:22.720
Who knew you'd be up
in the middle of the night

18:22.830 --> 18:24.760
and suddenly show up
outside the military camp?

18:24.770 --> 18:26.712
I have some private business
that may get bloody.

18:27.559 --> 18:29.159
I need the brothers' help.

18:29.464 --> 18:31.350
That's why
I had to gather everyone in secret.

18:31.359 --> 18:32.798
The brothers are all ready.

18:32.799 --> 18:34.038
Let's get to it.

18:34.039 --> 18:34.758
Enough talk.

18:34.759 --> 18:35.879
Let's do it.

18:36.839 --> 18:37.919
Good.

18:38.319 --> 18:39.560
Let's do it.

18:39.759 --> 18:41.399
That's my brother.

18:41.960 --> 18:43.240
Just like before,

18:44.400 --> 18:45.679
I'm trusting you

18:48.559 --> 18:49.919
to watch my back.

18:50.119 --> 18:51.040
All right.

18:52.240 --> 18:53.960
As long as I'm still breathing,

18:54.839 --> 18:57.399
no one will lay a hand
on you from behind.

18:58.200 --> 18:59.320
Let's go.

18:59.640 --> 19:01.358
We need to leave the city

19:01.359 --> 19:02.639
as soon as the gates open.

19:02.640 --> 19:04.520
Try not to alert anyone.

19:06.559 --> 19:07.320
All right.

19:07.359 --> 19:08.760
I'll change into civilian clothes.

19:08.880 --> 19:09.784
You go on ahead.

19:09.790 --> 19:10.838
I'll catch up with you.

19:10.839 --> 19:12.119
Already taken care of.

19:17.799 --> 19:19.280
I still need a different weapon.

19:19.599 --> 19:20.679
Don't worry.

19:24.359 --> 19:26.119
We've prepared a weapon for you, too.

19:27.880 --> 19:29.439
No one will see through your disguise.

19:36.359 --> 19:38.038
We're going to fight,

19:38.039 --> 19:39.278
not meet a prospective bride.

19:39.279 --> 19:40.598
Why all the fuss?

19:40.599 --> 19:41.639
Let's go.

19:52.060 --> 19:57.180
(Spring Breeze Carries the Seasons)

20:14.079 --> 20:15.480
Is this all we have?

20:17.960 --> 20:19.038
Given the circumstances,

20:19.039 --> 20:21.439
First Madam said
we'll have to make do.

20:23.480 --> 20:24.800
Just make do with this.

20:31.920 --> 20:33.359
Go ahead and eat.

20:33.480 --> 20:35.159
We only have eggs right now.

20:35.160 --> 20:35.639
Here.

20:35.640 --> 20:36.800
You can have this, too.

20:36.920 --> 20:38.079
I don't want it.

20:38.440 --> 20:39.679
I'll just have some porridge.

20:41.240 --> 20:42.879
Then don't eat it plain.

20:42.880 --> 20:44.240
It's too bland.

20:44.359 --> 20:45.520
Have some pickles.

21:05.559 --> 21:06.720
Cuique.

21:16.088 --> 21:17.128
I asked Fufang about it.

21:17.176 --> 21:20.240
Yesterday at the Hour of Xu,
the one who asked for hot water to bathe

21:20.720 --> 21:21.760
was Concubine Zhou.

21:26.799 --> 21:28.079
Keep an eye on things here.

21:28.240 --> 21:31.679
Take special care
of Young Lady Du and Lingdang.

21:45.880 --> 21:47.359
Don't just eat porridge.

21:47.440 --> 21:48.760
Have some pickles.

21:55.680 --> 21:57.439
Second Young Master,
Second Young Madam.

21:57.920 --> 21:59.480
Where is Concubine Zhou?

22:00.799 --> 22:02.518
She wanted to sleep a little longer.

22:02.519 --> 22:04.240
She hasn't left her room.

22:09.559 --> 22:10.839
What's the matter?

22:10.960 --> 22:11.760
Just tell us.

22:21.480 --> 22:24.320
Concubine Zhou
may have developed a red rash.

22:34.839 --> 22:35.879
Mother.

22:37.400 --> 22:38.399
Mother.

22:44.799 --> 22:46.560
Mother, open the door.

22:48.960 --> 22:50.720
Mother, open the door.

22:51.079 --> 22:52.399
Don't come in.

22:52.880 --> 22:54.118
Stay away from me.

22:54.119 --> 22:55.480
As far away as possible.

22:56.720 --> 22:57.720
Mother.

22:58.319 --> 22:59.598
Mother, come out and talk to me.

22:59.599 --> 23:02.719
I should've stayed
at Qingyan Hall last night.

23:02.720 --> 23:05.280
I shouldn't have come here with you.

23:06.160 --> 23:07.560
Jinlan, are you all right?

23:08.119 --> 23:09.399
Don't get worked up.

23:09.400 --> 23:11.679
Jinlan, don't get worked up.

23:11.799 --> 23:13.560
I'm fine.

23:14.599 --> 23:16.639
Don't make yourself ill.

23:17.880 --> 23:18.679
Don't worry.

23:18.680 --> 23:20.919
Second Young Master.
Please don't get worked up.

23:23.319 --> 23:25.318
I'm in a hurry
to take care of something.

23:25.319 --> 23:27.479
Young Master is already
trying to find a solution.

23:27.480 --> 23:28.639
I promise

23:28.880 --> 23:30.280
everything will be fine.

23:59.960 --> 24:01.439
Lingdang.

24:02.440 --> 24:04.079
Lingdang.

24:06.759 --> 24:08.879
Lingdang.

24:18.640 --> 24:22.399
Lingdang! How did this happen?

24:23.119 --> 24:25.399
My poor Lingdang.

24:25.640 --> 24:26.560
Lingdang.

24:27.960 --> 24:29.318
Lingdang, hold on.

24:29.319 --> 24:30.318
Lingdang.

24:30.319 --> 24:31.800
I can save you.

24:32.319 --> 24:33.399
Lingdang!

24:35.960 --> 24:37.399
Lingdang!

24:38.799 --> 24:39.679
Lingdang.

24:39.799 --> 24:41.038
I know medicine.

24:41.039 --> 24:41.639
I can save you.

24:41.640 --> 24:43.480
I promise I'll save you, Lingdang.

24:45.440 --> 24:46.439
Lingdang.

24:47.119 --> 24:48.119
Lingdang.

24:48.319 --> 24:49.359
Lingdang.

24:50.319 --> 24:54.159
Young Lady...

24:57.519 --> 25:00.119
- Lingdang.
- Lingdang.

25:01.759 --> 25:02.760
Lingdang.

25:25.240 --> 25:26.320
Lingdang.

25:26.799 --> 25:28.439
Lingdang.

25:36.400 --> 25:38.119
Lingdang.

25:40.319 --> 25:41.639
Lingdang.

25:53.839 --> 25:55.560
Lingdang.

25:56.960 --> 25:58.560
Lingdang.

26:07.000 --> 26:08.239
- Come back.
- Cuique.

26:08.240 --> 26:09.800
Don't be sad.

26:09.839 --> 26:11.078
She's already gone.

26:11.079 --> 26:12.239
You need to leave now.

26:12.240 --> 26:13.679
You'll catch the epidemic.

26:13.799 --> 26:15.318
Please, just get out of here.

26:15.319 --> 26:16.200
Go.

26:16.559 --> 26:17.800
Lingdang.

26:21.240 --> 26:22.639
Lingdang.

26:26.559 --> 26:27.720
Lanxiang.

26:29.480 --> 26:30.800
Lingdang.

26:35.000 --> 26:37.118
Lingdang's body can't stay here.

26:37.119 --> 26:38.919
Notify Yinchen at once.

26:39.960 --> 26:41.879
The one delivering the food
is still outside.

26:42.000 --> 26:43.560
They already know.

27:10.799 --> 27:11.558
You two,

27:11.559 --> 27:12.679
go lift the curtain.

27:19.839 --> 27:21.119
She has a fever.

27:24.400 --> 27:25.960
How is Fourth Young Lady?

27:26.799 --> 27:28.320
Her fever hasn't broken.

27:28.559 --> 27:29.879
She's still unconscious.

27:30.359 --> 27:33.159
The red rashes all over her body
have festered and ulcerated.

27:34.799 --> 27:36.159
First Madam was already

27:38.680 --> 27:41.040
deeply distressed
seeing Fourth Young Lady like that.

27:41.240 --> 27:42.879
It's only making her feel worse.

27:45.480 --> 27:47.320
What about Xiaolian and Yuchan?

27:48.319 --> 27:50.119
Xiaolian is unconscious, too.

27:51.240 --> 27:52.800
Yuchan is in the worst condition.

27:53.759 --> 27:55.480
The experienced nannies said

27:55.559 --> 27:57.599
she may not make it through the night.

27:59.799 --> 28:00.919
Lingdang.

28:01.039 --> 28:02.200
Lingdang.

