29:00.480 --> 29:03.260
♪As new wounds rise♪

29:03.860 --> 29:09.900
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

29:12.000 --> 29:13.720
Take me to Rongzhang House.

29:14.660 --> 29:17.579
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

29:17.580 --> 29:21.540
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

29:21.580 --> 29:24.059
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

29:24.060 --> 29:28.339
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

29:28.340 --> 29:31.579
♪And silver moonlight
to guide me through the night♪

29:31.580 --> 29:35.219
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

29:35.220 --> 29:40.620
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

29:57.799 --> 29:59.399
Lingdang.

30:15.400 --> 30:16.800
Don't just stand around.

30:17.079 --> 30:18.760
Don't you all have work to do?

30:23.319 --> 30:24.280
Right.

30:24.880 --> 30:25.800
Right.

30:26.240 --> 30:27.879
Get back to your work.

30:28.759 --> 30:29.879
Second Madam.

30:30.720 --> 30:33.879
Clean that room up properly.

30:33.920 --> 30:35.679
Make sure it's spotless.

30:36.079 --> 30:37.240
Yes.

30:38.279 --> 30:39.200
Xiuwan.

30:39.279 --> 30:40.200
Xiuwan.

30:41.359 --> 30:42.679
Come on. Take a walk with me.

30:44.079 --> 30:45.280
Yinxian.

30:45.960 --> 30:47.599
Go look after Cuique.

30:49.880 --> 30:50.599
Let's go.

31:17.880 --> 31:18.879
What's wrong?

31:19.559 --> 31:21.359
I've never seen her like this.

31:24.720 --> 31:26.399
Lingdang is dead.

31:28.720 --> 31:29.439
This...

31:31.880 --> 31:33.679
She was fine yesterday.

31:34.440 --> 31:35.879
How did she suddenly die?

31:37.079 --> 31:38.200
The epidemic.

31:39.128 --> 31:40.264
Even if it was the epidemic,

31:40.312 --> 31:41.750
it shouldn't have happened this fast.

31:41.759 --> 31:42.399
The others...

31:42.400 --> 31:43.879
Yinchen said

31:44.720 --> 31:48.960
Yuchan may not make it through tonight.

32:37.400 --> 32:42.159
Maybe Young Master will return today.

32:44.720 --> 32:47.040
What if Young Master
doesn't return until tomorrow?

32:49.559 --> 32:51.839
Can Yuchan hold on until tomorrow?

32:56.400 --> 32:58.159
We're only maids.

32:59.559 --> 33:01.480
Other than waiting
and leaving it to fate,

33:03.160 --> 33:04.800
there's nothing we can do.

33:08.359 --> 33:10.399
Who says there's nothing we can do?

33:12.880 --> 33:14.079
There is something we can do.

33:25.480 --> 33:28.280
Yuchan worked so hard
to climb out of hardship.

33:28.720 --> 33:30.879
She still wants to live a good life.

33:32.240 --> 33:34.679
Xiaolian still wants
to become a first-class maid

33:34.880 --> 33:37.919
so her mother won't have to collect
night soil late at night anymore.

33:39.400 --> 33:41.760
Madam Wu may
be shrewd and a little fierce,

33:42.640 --> 33:44.439
but she's fair in
how she handles things.

33:45.039 --> 33:47.040
She never shortchanges the junior maids.

33:49.640 --> 33:53.399
She's still waiting for Jiugao to marry
so she can become a mother-in-law.

34:00.160 --> 34:02.000
None of them has lived long enough.

34:03.480 --> 34:05.079
No one is allowed to die.

34:06.400 --> 34:08.399
We have to save them.

34:24.079 --> 34:24.999
Hua.

34:25.360 --> 34:26.158
The left side

34:26.159 --> 34:27.559
needs to be fumigated, too.

34:42.119 --> 34:43.359
Second Madam has probably

34:43.360 --> 34:45.038
never seen a dead body in her life.

34:45.039 --> 34:47.158
She must be upset and frightened,

34:47.159 --> 34:48.600
so she's keeping her distance.

34:49.079 --> 34:51.158
Fortunately, Young Lady Du
knows medicine.

34:51.159 --> 34:53.078
Once we've finished cleaning the room,

34:53.079 --> 34:55.479
Second Madam
can stay here without worry.

34:56.480 --> 34:57.559
That's right.

35:00.760 --> 35:02.760
Young Lady Du, Madam Han,

35:02.840 --> 35:04.118
have some tea and take a break.

35:04.119 --> 35:04.959
Yes.

35:04.960 --> 35:05.959
Have some tea first

35:05.960 --> 35:07.399
and soothe your throats.

35:08.559 --> 35:09.879
Thank you for your help.

35:10.639 --> 35:12.359
Think nothing of it.

35:13.599 --> 35:14.839
Now that Lingdang is gone,

35:14.840 --> 35:17.080
Young Lady Du,
please don't stand on ceremony.

35:18.000 --> 35:20.158
Treat these maids as your own

35:20.159 --> 35:21.600
and feel free to give them orders.

35:24.480 --> 35:25.879
Ever since I entered the residence,

35:26.039 --> 35:29.200
everyone from First Madam to the nannies
has treated me with great care.

35:29.519 --> 35:31.999
I've never considered
myself an outsider.

35:32.199 --> 35:33.678
That's right.

35:33.679 --> 35:36.200
First Madam likes that about you.

36:50.119 --> 36:51.479
I need to relieve myself.

36:52.000 --> 36:52.959
Me too.

36:55.639 --> 36:57.080
With all that filth,

36:57.679 --> 36:58.319
I can't believe

36:58.320 --> 37:00.160
you've managed to survive.

37:00.199 --> 37:01.680
You may not care if you live,

37:01.800 --> 37:03.600
but I'm not ready to die yet.

37:03.920 --> 37:04.839
Get down!

37:08.400 --> 37:09.519
In a moment,

37:10.320 --> 37:12.439
you watch Young Master's back.

37:12.519 --> 37:13.959
Charge straight ahead.

37:14.079 --> 37:15.600
I'll watch your back.

37:15.920 --> 37:17.240
If you kill an odd number,

37:17.400 --> 37:18.559
they're all yours.

37:18.880 --> 37:20.080
If you kill an even number,

37:20.920 --> 37:22.039
we split them evenly.

37:24.280 --> 37:25.160
Deal.

37:32.800 --> 37:33.800
Here they come.

37:50.079 --> 37:51.238
We're here to ambush

37:51.239 --> 37:54.120
Commander Yuan
of the Xinjiangkou Naval Camp?

37:57.159 --> 37:58.320
Scared?

38:03.559 --> 38:05.359
We have to make a clean job of it.

38:05.679 --> 38:07.320
We can't leave anyone alive.

38:10.639 --> 38:11.959
A brother like you,

38:12.000 --> 38:14.600
I, Lin Jinqi, will stand by for life.

38:18.559 --> 38:19.919
Look at their direction.

38:20.199 --> 38:23.120
Commander Yuan is heading
to Longjiang Shipyard.

38:25.440 --> 38:26.559
Look.

38:27.519 --> 38:29.279
It should rain tonight.

38:29.280 --> 38:32.160
The rain will wash away every trace.

38:32.320 --> 38:34.919
As long as we do a clean job,

38:35.280 --> 38:37.280
none of this
will have anything to do with us.

38:47.639 --> 38:49.080
What...

38:49.199 --> 38:51.519
How did someone beat us to it?

38:54.920 --> 38:55.800
Chief.

38:56.440 --> 38:58.158
Are we taking on both sides,

38:58.159 --> 38:59.999
or just one?

39:00.360 --> 39:01.479
Wait a little longer.

39:07.719 --> 39:09.800
Kill them!

39:29.960 --> 39:31.559
I am an official of the imperial court.

39:31.719 --> 39:33.118
I can say with a clear conscience

39:33.119 --> 39:34.839
that I have not failed
His Majesty's trust

39:34.840 --> 39:36.680
or wronged the people.

39:37.079 --> 39:38.279
Who might you be

39:38.280 --> 39:40.120
to come for my life?

39:40.960 --> 39:42.718
Avenge our fallen brothers!

39:42.719 --> 39:43.799
Kill!

39:43.800 --> 39:44.919
Kill!

39:47.079 --> 39:49.399
Kill!

39:49.920 --> 39:52.039
Avenge our fallen brothers!

39:52.280 --> 39:53.359
Brothers!

39:53.960 --> 39:56.559
We'll help Commander Yuan
kill the Wo pirates.

39:56.639 --> 39:59.120
Don't let those three over there escape!

40:00.920 --> 40:02.959
- All right!
- All right!

40:04.000 --> 40:06.638
Brothers, kill the Wo pirates!

40:06.639 --> 40:18.320
- Kill!
- Kill!

40:35.519 --> 40:40.559
- Kill!
- Kill!

41:16.400 --> 41:17.800
Xiushu.

41:17.960 --> 41:19.600
Mother is here.

41:22.119 --> 41:23.160
Don't be afraid.

41:48.840 --> 41:51.039
Bring Xiaolian some more water. Hurry!

41:51.944 --> 41:53.150
Is anyone else over there?

41:53.159 --> 41:54.600
Come help me!

42:19.144 --> 42:21.080
Where's the medicine
for Madam Wu and Yuchan?

42:56.920 --> 42:57.638
Young Master!

42:57.639 --> 42:58.680
Watch out!

